<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HAB" style="id"/>
  <para style="h">Habacuc</para>
  <para style="toc1">HABACUC</para>
  <para style="toc2">Habacuc</para>
  <para style="toc3">Hab</para>
  <para style="mt1">HABACUC</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HAB 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HAB 1:1"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 13:1">És 13:1</ref> </char>
    </note>Pwofesi ke Habacuc, pwofèt la te wè. <verse eid="HAB 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HAB 1:2"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 13:1">Sòm 13:1</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 13:2">2</ref></char></note>Pandan konbyen tan, O SENYÈ, mwen va kriye sekou e Ou pa tande? Mwen kriye a Ou menm, “Vyolans!” Men Ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 14:9">Jr 14:9</ref> </char></note>pa delivre. <verse eid="HAB 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HAB 1:3"/>Poukisa Ou fè m wè inikite, e Ou gade sou tout mechanste yo? Wi, se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 20:8">Jr 20:8</ref></char></note>destriksyon ak vyolans ki devan mwen; <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 15:10">Jr 15:10</ref> </char></note>gwo konfli ak kont k ap leve toupatou. <verse eid="HAB 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HAB 1:4"/>Akoz sa, yo vin pa okipe yo de lalwa e jistis la pa janm avanse. Paske mechan yo vin antoure moun ladwati yo. Lajistis tòde nèt.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 58:1">Sòm 58:1</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 58:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 5:20">És 5:20</ref></char></note><verse eid="HAB 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HAB 1:5"/>“Gade pami nasyon yo! Obsève byen! Se pou nou vin sezi e menm etone! Paske Mwen ap fè nan jou pa w yo, yon bagay ke ou pa t ap kwè, malgre ke ou ta tande l. <verse eid="HAB 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HAB 1:6"/>Paske, gade byen, Mwen ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:2">II Wa 24:2</ref></char></note>leve Kaldeyen yo, pèp fewòs e san kontwòl sa a, k ap mache sou tout tè a pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 8:10">Jr 8:10</ref> </char></note>sezi kote ki pa pou yo. <verse eid="HAB 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HAB 1:7"/>Yo plen tout moun ak gwo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 18:2">És 18:2</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 18:7">7</ref></char></note>laperèz, ak lakrent. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 39:5-9">Jr 39:5-9</ref> </char></note>Jistis ak otorite pa yo sòti sèl nan yo menm. <verse eid="HAB 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HAB 1:8"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 4:13">Jr 4:13</ref></char></note>Chevalye yo pi vit ke leyopa, e pi vijilan ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEP 3:3">So 3:3</ref> </char></note>lou lannwit. Chevalye yo vin galope. Chevalye yo sòti lwen. Yo vole tankou èg k ap plonje desann pou devore. <verse eid="HAB 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HAB 1:9"/>Yo tout vini pou fè vyolans. Nan rega pa yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 12:17">II Wa 12:17</ref> </char></note> se an avan. Yo ranmase kaptif tankou sab. <verse eid="HAB 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HAB 1:10"/>Yo giyonnen wa yo e yo moke gouvènè yo. Yo pase tout bastyon yo nan tenten. Yo sanble ranblè tè yo e yo sezi yo. <verse eid="HAB 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HAB 1:11"/>Tankou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 2:3">Jr 2:3</ref> </char></note>van yo va vole pase, pou yo ale nèt. Yo vrèman <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 4:11">Jr 4:11</ref></char></note>koupab; yo mete fòs yo nan dye pa yo a.”<verse eid="HAB 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HAB 1:12"/>Èske se pa nan letènite Ou sòti, O SENYÈ, Bondye mwen an, Sila Ki Sen mwen an? Nou p ap mouri. Ou menm, O SENYÈ, Ou te dezinye yo pou jijman an. Ou menm, O Woche a, Ou te etabli yo pou pinisyon. <verse eid="HAB 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HAB 1:13"/>Zye Ou twò pafè pou gade mal, e Ou pa ka menm gade mechanste. Poukisa Ou sipòte sila ki trèt yo? Poukisa Ou rete an silans pandan mechan yo ap vale sila ki pi jis pase yo?<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 50:21">Sòm 50:21</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 35:25">Sòm 35:25</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="HAB 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HAB 1:14"/>Poukisa kite yo fè lòm tankou pwason lanmè, tankou sila k ap trennen atè ki pa gen gouvènè sou yo? <verse eid="HAB 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HAB 1:15"/>Pou Kaldeyen yo, yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 16:16">Jr 16:16</ref> </char></note> rale yo fè yo tout monte ak yon zen. Yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 10:9">Sòm 10:9</ref></char></note>rale pote yo ale ak pèlen, e ranmase yo ansanm nan filè pwason. Se konsa y ap rejwi e fè kè kontan. <verse eid="HAB 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HAB 1:16"/>Tout sa, akoz yo ofri yon sakrifis a filè yo; yo brile lansan nan filè a; paske pa bagay sa yo, lavi a vin bon, e manje yo vin anpil. <verse eid="HAB 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HAB 1:17"/>Èske se konsa yap kontinye vide filè yo, e kontinye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:5">És 14:5</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 14:6">6</ref> </char></note>detwi nasyon yo san mizerikòd?<verse eid="HAB 1:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HAB 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HAB 2"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HAB 2:1"/>Mwen va kanpe sou pòs gad mwen, e mwen va pran pozisyon sou ranpa a. Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 5:3">Sòm 5:3</ref></char></note>veye san rete pou wè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 85:8">Sòm 85:8</ref> </char></note>ki sa Li va pale avèk mwen, ak jan pou m ta reponn, selon plent mwen pote bay L.<verse eid="HAB 2:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HAB 2:2"/>Konsa SENYÈ a te reponn mwen. Li te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 27:8">Det 27:8</ref> </char></note>“Ekri vizyon an e montre li klè sou tablo, pou sila k ap kouri a, ka li l. <verse eid="HAB 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HAB 2:3"/>Paske vizyon an toujou pou lè deziye a. La p pwoche vit pou rive nan bi li, ni li p ap fè fayit. Menmsi li fè reta, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 27:14">Sòm 27:14</ref></char></note>tann li; paske anverite, li va vini. Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 12:25">Éz 12:25</ref> </char></note>p ap fè mize. <verse eid="HAB 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HAB 2:4"/>Gade byen, kè l anfle. Nanm li pa dwat anndan l, men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:17">Wo 1:17</ref> </char></note>moun dwat la va viv pa lafwa li. <verse eid="HAB 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HAB 2:5"/>Anplis, diven devwale yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 21:24">Pwov 21:24</ref></char></note>moun ògeye, ki pa rete lakay li. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 27:20">Pwov 27:20</ref> </char></note>L ap ogmante apeti li tankou Sejou mò a. Epi konsa, li menm, tankou lanmò a, pa kapab satisfè. Li rasanble a li menm tout nasyon yo, e li ranmase tout pèp yo a li menm.<verse eid="HAB 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HAB 2:6"/>“Èske tout moun sa yo p ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:4-10">És 14:4-10</ref> </char></note>Leve yon chan mokè kont li, yon tire pwen kont li pou di: “Malè a sila ki ogmante sa ki pa pou li— pou jiskilè l ap fè tèt li rich ak chantay li yo?” <verse eid="HAB 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HAB 2:7"/>Èske moun ki dwe w yo p ap leve <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 29:1">Pwov 29:1</ref> </char></note>sibitman? Èske yo p ap vin souleve? Anverite, ou va vin piyaj pou yo. <verse eid="HAB 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HAB 2:8"/>Akoz ou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 33:1">És 33:1</ref> </char></note>piyaje anpil nasyon, tout retay pèp yo va piyaje ou. L ap konsa, akoz tout san moun ki vèse ak vyolans ki fèt nan peyi a, nan vil la, ak tout moun ki rete ladann yo.<verse eid="HAB 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HAB 2:9"/>“Malè a sila ki jwenn <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 22:13">Jr 22:13</ref></char></note>avantaj malonèt pou lakay li a, pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 49:16">Jr 49:16</ref> </char></note>mete nich li byen wo, pou l ta ka delivre soti nan men a gwo malè! <verse eid="HAB 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HAB 2:10"/>Ou te machinen yon gwo wont pou lakay ou nan detwi anpil pèp. Konsa, ou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 26:19">Jr 26:19</ref> </char></note>peche kont pwòp nanm ou. <verse eid="HAB 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HAB 2:11"/>Anverite, wòch la va kriye soti nan mi an, e poto travès la va reponn li.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 24:27">Jos 24:27</ref></char></note><verse eid="HAB 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HAB 2:12"/>“Malè a sila ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 3:10">Mi 3:10</ref> </char></note>bati yon vil ak san vèse, e ki fonde yon vil ak inikite! <verse eid="HAB 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HAB 2:13"/>Anverite, èske sa pa soti nan SENYÈ dèzame yo pou moun travay di pou dife a, e nasyon yo fatige kò yo pou granmesi?<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 50:11">És 50:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HAB 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HAB 2:14"/>Paske latè va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:27">Sòm 22:27</ref> </char></note>ranpli ak konesans ak laglwa SENYÈ a, tankou dlo kouvri lanmè.<verse eid="HAB 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HAB 2:15"/>“Malè a ou menm k ap fòse vwazen ou bwè, k ap mele gwòg pa w ladann, menm pou fè yo sou, pou gade toutouni yo! <verse eid="HAB 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HAB 2:16"/>Ou plen ak wont san onè. Konsa, ou va bwè ou menm e dekouvri pwòp toutouni pa ou. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 25:15">Jr 25:15</ref>,<ref loc="JER 25:17">17</ref></char></note>Tas nan men dwat SENYÈ a va vire tou won pou rive kote ou, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NAM 3:6">Na 3:6</ref> </char></note>wont total va ranplase laglwa ou. <verse eid="HAB 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HAB 2:17"/>Paske vyolans ki fèt Liban an va fè ou plonje desann, ansanm ak destriksyon a bèt va bay ou gwo laperèz; akoz de san vèse a moun ak vyolans tè a, nan chak vil la ak tout sila ki rete ladann yo.<verse eid="HAB 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HAB 2:18"/>“Ki pwofi ki gen nan zidòl la, lè mèt li fin taye l? Swa yon imaj, fome pa yon<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 10:8">Jr 10:8</ref>,<ref loc="JER 10:14">14</ref></char></note>pwofesè k ap bay manti? Paske sila menm ki te fè l la mete konfyans li nan pwòp zèv li a, lè l fòme zidòl ki bebe. <verse eid="HAB 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HAB 2:19"/>Malè a sila ki di a yon mòso bwa: ‘Leve!”, a yon wòch ki pa ka pale: “Kanpe!” Èske se sila a ki ka enstwi? Men gade byen, li kouvri nèt ak lò ak ajan, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 135:17">Sòm 135:17</ref> </char></note>pa gen okenn souf ladann. <verse eid="HAB 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HAB 2:20"/>Men SENYÈ a la nan sen tanp Li. Ke tout tè a fè silans devan Li.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 1:2">Mi 1:2</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 1:7">So 1:7</ref> </char></note><verse eid="HAB 2:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HAB 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HAB 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HAB 3:1"/>Yon priyè Habacuc, pwofèt la, selon fòm Sigonoth la.<verse eid="HAB 3:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HAB 3:2"/>SENYÈ, mwen te tande yon rapò sou Ou menm</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:2">e mwen kanpe etonnen nèt.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:2">O SENYÈ, fè zèv ou yo leve ankò nan mitan ane yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:2">Fè yo vin koni nan mitan ane yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:2">Nan chalè kòlè, Ou, sonje mizerikòd.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 71:20">Sòm 71:20</ref>; <ref loc="HAB 1:5">Hab 1:5</ref> </char></note><verse eid="HAB 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HAB 3:3"/>Bondye soti nan Théman;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:3">Sila ki Sen an soti nan Mòn <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 49:7">Jr 49:7</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 21:21">Jen 21:21</ref> </char></note>Paran. <char style="qs">Tan </char></para>
  <para style="b" vid="HAB 3:3"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:3">Bèlte Li kouvri syèl la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:3">e tè a vin plen ak lwanj Li.<verse eid="HAB 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HAB 3:4"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 18:12">Sòm 18:12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ekla Li tankou reyon solèy la.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:4">Gen tras klate limyè ki soti nan men L,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:4">e nanpwen anyen ki kache de <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 26:14">Job 26:14</ref> </char></note>pouvwa Li.<verse eid="HAB 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HAB 3:5"/>Devan Li, tout kalite touman mache;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:5">dèyè Li, epidemi a swiv sou pye L.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:29-30">Egz 12:29-30</ref></char></note><verse eid="HAB 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HAB 3:6"/>Li te kanpe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:6">tè a te sikwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:6">Li te gade;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:6">nasyon yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 21:18">Job 21:18</ref>; <ref loc="HAB 1:12">Hab 1:12</ref></char></note>etone.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:6">Wi, lansyen mòn yo te vin detwi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:6">ansyen kolin yo te vin efondre.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:6">Chemen li yo dire jis pou tout tan.<verse eid="HAB 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HAB 3:7"/>Mwen te wè tant a Cush yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 15:14-16">Egz 15:14-16</ref></char></note> anba detrès.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:7">Rido tant a Madian yo t ap tranble.<verse eid="HAB 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HAB 3:8"/>Èske SENYÈ a te malkontan ak rivyè yo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:8">Èske se ak rivyè yo Ou te fache?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:8">Oswa, èske kòlè Ou te kont lanmè a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:8">ki fè Ou te monte sou cheval Ou yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:8">sou cha delivrans Ou yo?<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 7:19">Egz 7:19</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 7:20">20</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 14:16">Egz 14:16</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 14:21">21</ref> </char></note><verse eid="HAB 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HAB 3:9"/>Ou te rale banza a soti nan fouwo l;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:9">Ou te rele flech ou yo fè semàn an. <char style="qs">Selah.</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:9">Ou te fann tè a ak rivyè yo.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 78:16">Sòm 78:16</ref></char></note><verse eid="HAB 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HAB 3:10"/>Mòn yo te wè, Ou e yo te tranble.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:10">Flèv dlo yo te kouri desann.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:10">Pwofondè a te gwononde.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:10">Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 93:3">Sòm 93:3</ref></char></note> leve men l anlè.<verse eid="HAB 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HAB 3:11"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 10:12-14">Jos 10:12-14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Solèy la ak lalin nan te kanpe nan plas yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:11">Nan eklè flèch Ou yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:11">ak briyans lans Ou yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:11">solay ak lalin nan te kanpe sou plas.<verse eid="HAB 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HAB 3:12"/>Nan gwo kòlè Ou, Ou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 68:7">Sòm 68:7</ref></char></note>mache travèse tè a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:12">Nan kòlè Ou, Ou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 41:15">És 41:15</ref> </char></note>foule mache sou nasyon yo.<verse eid="HAB 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HAB 3:13"/>Ou te soti pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 15:2">Egz 15:2</ref></char></note>delivrans a pèp Ou a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:13">pou sali pèp onksyon Ou an.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:13">Ou te frape tèt peyi mechanste an.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:13">Ou te ekspoze li nèt,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:13">depi nan kwis li pou rive nan kou l. <char style="qs">Selah. </char><verse eid="HAB 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HAB 3:14"/>Ou te frennen tèt gèye li yo ak pwòp nepe yo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:14">Yo te antre kon toubiyon pou gaye nou.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:14">Ak gwo lajwa yo te tankou sila</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:14">ki devore malere an sekrè yo.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 11:40">Dan 11:40</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 10:8">Sòm 10:8</ref> </char></note><verse eid="HAB 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HAB 3:15"/>Ou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 77:19">Sòm 77:19</ref></char></note>foule mache sou lanmè a</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:15">ak cheval Ou yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:15">sou lam lanmè a k ap boulvèse dlo a.<verse eid="HAB 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HAB 3:16"/>Mwen te tande,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:16">e zantray mwen te tranble.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:16">Lèv mwen te tranble ak son vwa a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:16">Pouiti la lantre nan zo m,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:16">mwen te tranble sou plas,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:16">paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 21:19">Luc 21:19</ref></char></note>mwen oblije tann jou detrès la, byen kal,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:16">tan pèp la k ap leve vin anvayi nou.<verse eid="HAB 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HAB 3:17"/>Menmsi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 1:10-12">Jl 1:10-12</ref></char></note>pye fig la pa ta fleri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:17">ni pa gen fwi sou branch rezen yo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:17">menmsi donn oliv la vin sispann,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:17">e chan yo pa pwodwi manje,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:17">menmsi bann mouton an ta koupe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:17">separe de pak la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:17">e pa gen bèf nan pak la,<verse eid="HAB 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HAB 3:18"/>mwen va toujou egzalte nan SENYÈ a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:18">Mwen va rejwi nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 25:5">Sòm 25:5</ref></char></note>Bondye, sali mwen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:18">Mwen va ranpli ak jwa akoz delivrans mwen an.<verse eid="HAB 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HAB 3:19"/>Senyè BONDYE mwen an se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 18:32">Sòm 18:32</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 18:33">33</ref></char></note>fòs mwen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:19">Li te fè pye mwen vin tankou pye sèf;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="HAB 3:19">Li te ban m fòs pou mache sou wo plas yo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HAB 3:19">Pou direktè koral la, sou enstriman a kòd mwen yo.<verse eid="HAB 3:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HAB 3"/>
</usx>
